00:53:57.656 --> 00:54:00.760
&gt;&gt; Yes. So, I mean, the theory says

00:54:00.761 --> 00:54:03.490
it is a linguistic theory
really at its core.

00:54:03.491 --> 00:54:08.290
So, the sociologist started
this symbolic interaction.

00:54:08.291 --> 00:54:10.270
So, again, based on symbols.

00:54:10.271 --> 00:54:13.360
The concept is that,

00:54:13.361 --> 00:54:16.915
let say I walk in
a hospital and I see a guy,

00:54:16.916 --> 00:54:20.720
a person in a white lab coat.

00:54:21.900 --> 00:54:25.765
My cognitive processes
will say, oh doctor,

00:54:25.766 --> 00:54:28.765
this is a doctor and
then I'll associate

00:54:28.766 --> 00:54:33.160
